   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Sources: docs/architecture/{network,hardware}.md, docs/services/*.md, k8s/asgard/. Zone scheme: xiiisins.com (public) / midgard.xiiisins.com (internal alias) / niflheim.xiiisins.com (internal only).\nJotunheim (a second K3s cluster) was dropped on 2026-10-05; its names and ID ranges stay reserved. Jellyfin and PBS are privileged LXCs on Urd, outside K3s.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Sources: docs/architecture/{network,hardware}.md, docs/services/*.md, k8s/asgard/. Zone scheme: xiiisins.com (public) / midgard.xiiisins.com (internal alias) / niflheim.xiiisins.com (internal only).\nJotunheim (a second K3s cluster) was dropped on 2026-10-05; its names and ID ranges stay reserved. Jellyfin and PBS are privileged LXCs on Urd, outside K3s.",
